.TH "ARC-PROFILES" "5" "2026-09-27" "arc-cli" "Arc Manual"
.SH "NAME"
arc\-profiles \- reusable Arc option profiles
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Profiles live under [profiles.NAME]. Scalar defaults apply before explicit CLI options, and profile filter rules run before command\-line rules so the CLI remains final last\-match\-wins authority.
.SH "FIELDS"
backend, progress, level, threads, yazi, show_native, native_style, execution, include, exclude, include_from, exclude_from.
.SH "EXAMPLE"
[profiles.backup]
.PP
level = 8
.PP
threads = 0
.PP
exclude = ['.git/', '__pycache__/']
.PP
.PP
arc create backup \-tzst src/ \-\-profile backup
.SH "SEE ALSO"
arc(1), arc\-config(5)
